  "label": "Adolf Hitler",
  "description": "The central figure in the image, Adolf Hitler was the dictator of Nazi Germany from 1933 until his death in 1945. He was the primary architect of the Holocaust, which resulted in the systematic murder of approximately 6 million Jews, along with millions of others including Roma, disabled people, Poles, and Soviet prisoners of war. His image is globally recognized and carries immense historical weight, making the meme's use of it deeply offensive and hateful.",
